As egg yearns for sky,
And seed 
Stretches to tree,
You became --
Like me.

Oh,
But there's
So much
You and I,
Child,
Have just begun.

Think:
Worlds from now
What might we be? --
We,
Who are seed
Of Diety.

(Carl Lynn Pearson)


